    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jagoondo</strong>\u00a0is a survival game set in extreme heat, where you play as a goblin that goes by the name\u00a0<strong><i>\u201cPrettyboy\u201d</i></strong>\u00a0who\u2019s just a little late to the evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll be doing a lot of running, crafting, building heat-resistant gear, gathering resources, exploring abandoned areas, and diving into the noble sciences to tinker with strange Goblin techs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/829980/extras/5027f8fb0813b6c05bd5242fbc9f1187.avif?t=1751668070\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To escape the heat, you\u2019ll need to take shelter in hideouts and cozy little caves. The distance between main shelters is no joke! You'll need to prep carefully before setting out on one of those treks! Even a simple run for supplies can get seriously dangerous if you don\u2019t learn the area or gear up right, it\u2019s easy to get lost and end up roasted!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/829980/extras/8ce2c9990ddf4faef1ddfe272e2d9cf4.avif?t=1751668070\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jagoondo</strong>\u00a0is a survival game set in extreme heat, where you play as a goblin that goes by the name\u00a0<strong><i>\u201cPrettyboy\u201d</i></strong>\u00a0who\u2019s just a little late to the evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll be doing a lot of running, crafting, building heat-resistant gear, gathering resources, exploring abandoned areas, and diving into the noble sciences to tinker with strange Goblin techs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/829980/extras/5027f8fb0813b6c05bd5242fbc9f1187.avif?t=1751668070\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To escape the heat, you\u2019ll need to take shelter in hideouts and cozy little caves. The distance between main shelters is no joke! You'll need to prep carefully before setting out on one of those treks! Even a simple run for supplies can get seriously dangerous if you don\u2019t learn the area or gear up right, it\u2019s easy to get lost and end up roasted!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/829980/extras/8ce2c9990ddf4faef1ddfe272e2d9cf4.avif?t=1751668070\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
